    "name": "Data Export Get Fields API",
    "description": "Export data in bulk from the Demandbase platform.\n\nAuthenticate using a bearer token. Pass a header like: `Authorization: {{bearer_token}}`\n\nThe part after 'Bearer' is your API token.\nFor instructions on generating API tokens, see the Generate and Manage API Key Set article at the Demandbase Help Center",
